      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before Europeans arrived, the area was home to Algonquian‑speaking Powhatan tribes like the Pamunkey and Arrohattoc.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
