      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/innsbrook_virginia",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Innsbrook sits roughly 13 miles northwest of Richmond’s downtown, near the confluence of two major interstates.",
